### @env local

### 1.1 获取[超级管理员] Token (openid_001 是超管)
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "openid_001"
}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.token); %}


### 1.2 获取[普通用户A] Token (正常用户)
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "openid_002"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.token); %}


### 1.3 获取[普通用户B] Token (用于测试多用户评论)
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "openid_003"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_b_token", response.body.token); %}


### 2.1 用户A 发表评论 (正常流程)
POST {{baseURL}}/comment/post
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "performanceId": 1,
  "content": "这场演出太精彩了！必须点赞！"
}

### 2.2 用户B 发表评论
POST {{baseURL}}/comment/post
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_b_token}}

{
  "performanceId": 1,
  "content": "前排占座，期待下一次！"
}

### 2.3 尝试评论不存在的演出 (预期失败)
POST {{baseURL}}/comment/post
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "performanceId": 9999,
  "content": "这评论发不出去"
}

### 2.4 尝试发送空内容 (预期失败 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseURL}}/comment/post
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "performanceId": 1,
  "content": ""
}


### 3.1 分页查询评论 (默认按时间倒序)
GET {{baseURL}}/comment/list?performanceId=2&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}


### 4.1 管理员将某条评论设为“隐藏” (状态=0)
# 注意：你需要将下面的 commentId 替换为实际数据库中存在的 ID (例如刚才发表的ID)
PUT {{baseURL}}/comment/audit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "commentId": 1,
  "status": 0
}

### 4.2 再次查询列表 (刚才隐藏的评论应该看不到了)
GET {{baseURL}}/comment/list?performanceId=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 4.3 管理员恢复评论 (状态=1)
PUT {{baseURL}}/comment/audit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "commentId": 1,
  "status": 1
}


### 5.1 物理删除评论 (仅超管可用)
DELETE {{baseURL}}/comment/6
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 5.2 普通用户尝试删除 (预期失败 403/500)
DELETE {{baseURL}}/comment/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}